  "exactPermissionParagraph": "Lunar force checks require an eligible night Moon. Near-new, below-horizon, daylight and unavailable-surface cases cannot gain moonlight from a diagnostic flag. Retain the physical scene inputs and crops for optics, and the real 15\u201360 second watch/clip/delta for motion; never use `qaState().clouds.hash` as motion proof.",
  "literalInventory": [
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 48,
      "text": "  star scintillation, sky breathing) via `&debugMotion=1` \u0394 / a clip / a centroid-drift probe. **Must NOT cite the",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 90,
      "text": "  drift/morph, stars scintillate, sky breathes). Proven by a real watch / `&debugMotion=1` \u0394, NEVER the qaState",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 91,
      "text": "  hash. Accessibility: `prefers-reduced-motion` reduces it by default; `&motion=full` overrides.**",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 102,
      "text": "`debugMotion` 10s\u201360s \u0394** (the headline gate), 5m/15m/60m/day simulated deltas, and `motion=full` vs reduced-motion.",
      "classification": "ENUM_OR_DIAGNOSTIC_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 108,
      "text": "  / `&debugMotion=1` 10s\u201360s \u0394 \u2014 **NOT** the `qaState().clouds.hash` (it flips on sub-pixel change and lies).",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
