    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 186,
      "text": "  scintillate, sky breathe. `&debugMotion=1` shows rAF/s, cloud-paint/s, reduced-motion, paused, **cloud \u0394 10s/60s**,",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 187,
      "text": "  star \u0394, reason. `&motion=full` forces motion under OS reduced-motion. `&timeScale=1800` fast-forwards a day.",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "AGENTS.md",
      "line": 190,
      "text": "- Readouts: `&debugLayers=1`, `&debugMoon=1`, `&debugMotion=1`, `&qa=1` then `window.qaState()` (incl. `wxTruth`,",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "DESIGN.md",
      "line": 301,
      "text": "  \"Live motion\".) The fragment's `timeScale` sets the explicit scene clock rate; `timeScale=1` remains an anchored 1\u00d7 preview. A query-only `?timeScale=` is ignored. Reduced-motion holds the cloud motion axes.",
      "classification": "EXPLICIT_QUERY_NOT_READ_CAVEAT"
    },
    {
      "file": "DESIGN.md",
      "line": 318,
      "text": "  may repaint dirty state at those held axes; `&motion=full` overrides the preference. Healthy live coverage **eases**",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "DESIGN.md",
      "line": 455,
      "text": "  OS `prefers-reduced-motion` unless `&motion=full` overrides it.",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "DESIGN.md",
      "line": 467,
      "text": "  weather animation and the cloud loop holds **frozen motion axes** (dirty state may repaint). `&motion=full` is an honest",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
      "file": "DESIGN.md",
      "line": 470,
      "text": "- **`&debugMotion=1`** overlays live telemetry: rAF ticks/s, cloud-paint/s, reduced-motion, `motion=full`, paused,",
      "classification": "APPEND_INSIDE_FRAGMENT_POSITIVE_OR_PROSE"
    },
    {
